{
  "algorithmId": "pcm-cumulative-ceil-v1",
  "captionCues": [
    {
      "chunkId": "layers-find-patterns-01",
      "endFrame": 99,
      "meaningId": "layers-find-patterns",
      "startFrame": 12,
      "text": "电脑怎么认出照片里是一只猫？"
    },
    {
      "chunkId": "layers-find-patterns-02",
      "endFrame": 258,
      "meaningId": "layers-find-patterns",
      "startFrame": 104,
      "text": "深度学习的办法，是让多层神经网络逐层寻找模式。"
    },
    {
      "chunkId": "features-build-up-01",
      "endFrame": 397,
      "meaningId": "features-build-up",
      "startFrame": 258,
      "text": "前面的层先发现边缘、颜色和纹理。"
    },
    {
      "chunkId": "features-build-up-02",
      "endFrame": 579,
      "meaningId": "features-build-up",
      "startFrame": 397,
      "text": "后面的层再把它们组合成耳朵、眼睛，最后判断是不是猫。"
    },
    {
      "chunkId": "training-adjusts-weights-01",
      "endFrame": 690,
      "meaningId": "training-adjusts-weights",
      "startFrame": 579,
      "text": "这些本领不是程序员一条条写进去的。"
    },
    {
      "chunkId": "training-adjusts-weights-02",
      "endFrame": 891,
      "meaningId": "training-adjusts-weights",
      "startFrame": 690,
      "text": "训练时，网络看大量例子，猜错就根据误差调整内部连接的权重。"
    },
    {
      "chunkId": "depth-enables-learning-01",
      "endFrame": 1026,
      "meaningId": "depth-enables-learning",
      "startFrame": 891,
      "text": "所谓深度，主要就是处理中间信息的层数很多。"
    },
    {
      "chunkId": "depth-enables-learning-02",
      "endFrame": 1218,
      "meaningId": "depth-enables-learning",
      "startFrame": 1026,
      "text": "层层积累后，它能处理图像、语音和文字中的复杂规律。"
    },
    {
      "chunkId": "power-has-limits-01",
      "endFrame": 1304,
      "meaningId": "power-has-limits",
      "startFrame": 1218,
      "text": "但它不是像人一样真正理解世界。"
    },
    {
      "chunkId": "power-has-limits-02",
      "endFrame": 1429,
      "meaningId": "power-has-limits",
      "startFrame": 1304,
      "text": "数据有偏、场景变化，它也可能自信地犯错。"
    },
    {
      "chunkId": "power-has-limits-03",
      "endFrame": 1684,
      "meaningId": "power-has-limits",
      "startFrame": 1434,
      "text": "所以，深度学习就是用多层网络，从数据中训练出识别模式的能力。"
    }
  ],
